{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"zai-org/CodeGeeX4","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/112","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/112/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/112/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/112/events","html_url":"https://github.com/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/112","id":3033054046,"node_id":"I_kwDOMRdAoc60yLte","number":112,"title":"feature:Strongly recommend adding a Database similar to https://deepwiki.com/.","user":{"login":"021gink","id":134119039,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_5-fw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134119039?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/021gink","html_url":"https://github.com/021gink","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/021gink/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/021gink/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/021gink/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/021gink/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/021gink/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/021gink/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/021gink/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/021gink/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/021gink/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-05-01T03:02:42Z","updated_at":"2025-09-04T08:50:05Z","closed_at":"2025-09-04T08:50:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"CodeGeeX excels at code explanation and comprehension. I typically use this plugin to analyze and read code from GitHub open-source projects. \n\nWith the emergence of DeepWiki, I've realized it's an even more versatile tool. Beyond Q&A, it can rapidly and accurately generate code examples for desired functionalities based on existing project source code. It also highlights the source code snippets it references, significantly enhancing the accuracy of the example code.\n\nI believe it won't be long before DeepWiki introduces an API or MCP, providing programming models with a powerful external code database that can be called upon.\n\nDeepWiki serves as a remote code data resource, and CodeGeeX could consider implementing local code repository integration capabilities. Users often download numerous PyPI libraries, many of which are also open-source projects on GitHub. Knowing how to use these libraries effectively for rapid development is crucial. For instance, if a user downloads the LangChain library locally, to utilize LangChain for development, they would have to visit the official website, review the official examples and basic usage, and then delve into understanding the function links within the underlying files. Only then can they consider how to correctly transplant and assemble these functional blocks into new scenarios. DeepWiki appears to have already overcome the challenge of combining code functions across multiple code files.\n","closed_by":{"login":"021gink","id":134119039,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_5-fw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134119039?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/021gink","html_url":"https://github.com/021gink","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/021gink/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/021gink/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/021gink/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https:/